---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer & Privacy"
  description="Financial disclaimer and privacy policy for MoneyMattersDaily."
>
  <h1>Disclaimer &amp; Privacy</h1>

  <h2>Not financial advice</h2>
  <p>
    MoneyMattersDaily provides general, informational content about personal
    finance topics. Nothing on this site constitutes financial, legal, tax,
    or investment advice, and it isn't a substitute for advice from a
    licensed professional who knows your specific situation. Rules, rates,
    and figures referenced in articles can change after publication — always
    verify current numbers before acting on them.
  </p>

  <h2>No liability</h2>
  <p>
    We make a good-faith effort to keep information accurate and up to date,
    but we can't guarantee completeness or that it applies to your
    circumstances. Any decisions you make based on this content are your own.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    This site may display third-party advertisements. Ad partners may use
    cookies or similar technology to serve relevant ads and measure
    performance. We don't control what individual advertisers do with that
    data — check the relevant ad network's own privacy policy for details.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We don't run account sign-ups, newsletters, or lead-gen forms, so we
    don't collect personal information beyond what's inherent to serving a
    web page (standard server/hosting logs) and whatever cookies our ad
    partners set once advertising is active. If you email us, we keep that
    correspondence only as long as needed to respond.
  </p>

  <p>
    Questions about this policy? Reach out via our
    <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
